Mediterranean anchovy case-study materials
-------------------------------------------

Prepared climate tables and rendered figures use Bio-ORACLE v3 data:

Assis J, Fernandez Bejarano SJ, Salazar VW, et al. (2024). Bio-ORACLE
v3.0. Pushing marine data layers to the CMIP6 Earth system models of
climate change research. Global Ecology and Biogeography 33: e13813.
https://doi.org/10.1111/geb.13813

The Bio-ORACLE metadata record identifies the source data licence as the GNU
General Public License. The prepared climate values retain the applicable
source licence and attribution terms.

The fitted species distribution model was derived from occurrence records
queried from the Ocean Biodiversity Information System (OBIS). Data providers
retain ownership of their records, and use is subject to the licence attached
to each source dataset. No unmodified OBIS occurrence records are distributed
with this package. See https://manual.obis.org/policy.html.

Map boundaries were derived from:

Flanders Marine Institute (2018). IHO Sea Areas, version 3.
https://doi.org/10.14284/323

No source Marine Regions geometry is distributed with this package. Source
products remain subject to the Marine Regions terms of use and attribution
requirements at https://www.marineregions.org/disclaimer.php.
